 "The source of the Decay\ntearing apart Gavel lies\nwithin the great Nexus at the\nheart of the Realm of Light.\nThe Light itself is fading.\nIts embodiment is suffering.\nSave Him.": "撕裂 Gavel 的黯蝕，其源頭就在 Realm of Light 中心的那座大樞紐裡。光本身正在消逝，它的化身正在受苦。救救祂。",
 "Homes ravaged by Decay, the\nsubterranean Grootslangs\nsearch frantically for a\nbetter habitat. Though they\nharbor no ill intent, they\npose a significant risk for\nthe people of {p}, and\nperhaps for all of Gavel.": "家園被黯蝕摧毀之後，地底的 Grootslang 拚命尋找更好的棲地。牠們並無惡意，卻對 {p} 的居民構成重大威脅——或許對整個 Gavel 都是。",
 "Void Holes are strange... Are\nthey natural? Or are they\nartificial? What makes them?\nWhat happens to the matter\nwhich they replace? A\nparticularly large Void Hole\nrests within the centre of\nthe Silent Expanse, perhaps\nit holds the answer to these\nquestions...": "虛空洞十分詭異……它們是自然形成的嗎？還是人為的？是什麼造出了它們？被它們取代的物質又去了哪裡？The Silent Expanse 的正中央有一個特別巨大的虛空洞，或許答案就在那裡……",
 "On the brink of war, Fruma\nfaces devastation from within\nthe palace walls. Its source\nmust be stopped, at all costs.": "戰爭一觸即發，而 Fruma 的浩劫來自王宮高牆之內。無論付出什麼代價，都必須阻止它的源頭。",
