 "Famished's Gambit": "飢餓者的賭注",
 "You cannot heal more than {~}\nmax health over {~} second": "每 {~2} 秒內，你回復的生命不能超過最大生命的 {~1}",
 "Taking damage additionally\ndeals {~} more damage for\nevery second since last being\nhit. Max {~}.": "距離上次被擊中每過一秒，你受到的傷害就額外增加 {~1}，最多 {~2}。",
 "Each time you die, deal -{~}\ndamage for the rest of the\nraid": "你每死亡一次，這場討伐戰剩下的時間裡造成的傷害就 -{~}",
 "You have -{~} less Raid Buff\nchoice.": "你的討伐戰增益選項少 {~} 個。",
 "In its effort to protect\nGavel, the Canyon Colossus\ninstead only endangers the\nprovince. With nobody to\nmaintain it for centuries, it\nis on the verge of tearing\nthe land asunder. It must be\ncalmed, as soon as possible.": "峽谷巨像為了守護 Gavel，反而讓整個行省陷入險境。數百年來無人維護，它已瀕臨把大地撕裂的邊緣。必須盡快讓它平息下來。",
 "✖ Remaining Rerolls: {~}": "✖ 剩餘重抽次數：{~}"
